   "beaten_path": 5,
   "daily_driver": 5,
   "sensible_spice": 3,
   "everyday_livability": 5,
   "expert_rank": 3,
   "rationale": "Extremely livable and conventional: the Aqua Terra 38 is a near-perfect everything watch, and the blue pilot chronograph adds sporty colour and a column-wheel chrono. But both are steel-bracelet sport watches of similar register, so the second watch is more a mood change than a gap-filler; no dressier option for suit or formal days."
  },
  "PAIR-Z": {
