   "makes_sense_together": 4,
   "beaten_path": 4,
   "daily_driver": 5,
   "sensible_spice": 3,
   "everyday_livability": 5,
   "expert_rank": 1,
   "rationale": "The White Birch Spring Drive is a superb office-to-dinner anchor with dressy credibility, and the SeaQ 39.5 adds a true 200 m diver with blue colour for weekends, sport and water. Shared values (serious in-house movements, finishing) with a clear dress-sport versus tool split, though both are ~40 mm steel-bracelet watches, which limits differentiation. Covers the default wearer's year with the fewest compromises."
